# A search for a quality may find nothing (CR 701.23b): the library holds no artifact or enchantment, so Bot1 finds nothing, the
# Tutor still resolves to the graveyard, and the next draw is some card of the library. The Tutor is cast on turn one, so the
# library has eight cards afterwards, none of them moved to the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Enlightened Tutor
Plains x5
Lightning Bolt
Island
Counterspell
Plains x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Enlightened Tutor.Cast
! Bot1.Search(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Search()

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Enlightened Tutor
Bot1.Library.Count = 8
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
